        "description": "Implemented Policy Engine (Path A) per spec specs/policy-engine.md. Schema v5 (check_kind/check_expr/severity columns on system_patterns). New commands: pattern log --check-kind/--check/--severity, rules export --harness omp, install --harness omp, check (--staged/--paths, exit 1 on violations). Rules module exports omp-compatible TTSR rule files with frontmatter, deterministic manifest, write-through on pattern log/delete, doctor staleness check. Check runner: regex engine (in-process) + ast-grep shell-out. Dogfooded: rules 002-005 registered as patterns 7-10, exported to .omp/rules/. 50 tests green (35 cli + 15 policy). Fixed CWD-fallback bug in write_through/staleness that could corrupt cross-workspace rule files."
